<title>INDONESIA: Indal plans venture with Japanese firm.</title>
<headline>Indal plans venture with Japanese firm.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesian alumunium product manufacturer PT Indal Alumunium Industry said on Thursday the firm was planning a joint venture with a Japanese partner to manufacture automobile components.</p>
<p>&quot;But we still cannot mention the name of our prospective partner from Japan,&quot; said a company official.</p>
<p>She said the venture will manufacture components including cabling systems and tubes and will be in operation by the end of 1997.</p>
<p>The company official declined to give further details.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
